  (text_box "HDMI output\n\nAUDIO\n + 8 output channels minimum for main audio\n + 2 channel input for am/fm radio\n + 1 channel output for external radio\n + 1 channel input for external radio\n\nM2.B card for 4g addon\nM2.E card for wifi/bluetooth\nM2.M card for storage\n\nusb2\n + I touchscreen\n + I other stuff\n + E user charge only\n + E user charge only\n + E user charge only\n\nusb-c\n + user interface\n\nusb-3\n + user interface\n\ngpio\n + O winch in\n + O winch out\n + O4 window up\n + O4 window down\n + O door lock\n + O door unlock\n + O external radio trigger\n + O general led indicator\n + O fingerprint enable\n + O inverter enable\n + O4 light(s) control\n + O4 aux outputs\n + I potentiometer A for volume (quadrature)\n + I potentiometer B for volume (quadrature)\n + I potentiometer A for adjust (quadrature)\n + I potentiometer B for adjust (quadrature)\n + I button A\n + I button B\n + I fingerprint IRQ\n + I4 aux inputs\n\nuart\n + fingerprint sensor (3.3v)\n + GPS sensor\n\npcie\n + cameras add-on (on board)\n\n1G ethernet port\n\nNFC - ?\n\nam/fm radio control - ?\nam/fm radio data - ?\n\nsystem fan control and tachometer\n\nsim card connector ?"
    (at 223.52 13.97 0) (size 55.88 149.86)
    (stroke (width 0) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid c1efc093-4a4f-4c74-8510-500c3ac5b897)
  )

